          h2 Tip of the day @584,1026,69,42
          text Linking articles: the internal link @584,1080,69,102
          text (AKA Wikilinks) are a great way to alert users to pertinent information. However, remember that can detract from an article. Only create links that are relevant to the context of the article. @584,1194,69,467
